FILE: file_loader.py
PURPOSE: Loads Excel/CSV/PDF files; normalises column headers to snake_case; registers DataFrame in DuckDB.
IMPORTS: re, duckdb, pandas, pdfplumber, session

FUNCTIONS:
  load_dataframe(filepath) -> pd.DataFrame
    Reads .xlsx/.xls with openpyxl or .csv; calls _normalize_headers_inplace.

  load_into_duckdb(df, session)
    Registers df as "data" table in session.duck_conn (in-memory DuckDB).

  load_pdf_pages(filepath) -> list[dict]
    Extracts text from each PDF page via pdfplumber; returns [{page_num, text}, ...].

  _to_snake_case(name) -> str
  _normalize_headers_inplace(filepath, df) -> pd.DataFrame
    Renames columns and overwrites the source file.
